# Ice Cream Cake with Cookie Filling

## Ingredients
#### 10 scoops vanilla ice cream
#### 2 vanilla beans
#### 1 pack of oreos
#### 1 pack Betty Crocker Cake Vanilla Cake Mix

---

## Steps:
1. Make Betty Crocker Cake according to box recipes
2. Put the ice cream on top of the cake
3. Crush the oreos and put on the ice cream
4. Vanilla bean topping

